Z||000000||flexableface||09-19-2000||01:38 PM||||i was wondering if any one has every used this brand of chip? <A HREF="http://www.jetchip.com" TARGET=_blank>www.jetchip.com</A>  they have a nice page and it shows the h/p gains. it says that the chip will give 12-14 h/p to a stock v-6 auto. does it sound worth it or not??? thanks luke||||reg||1
Z||000001||HYPTNOTiSE||09-19-2000||02:16 PM||||12-14 hp i do not believe. period.  That is a hell of a lot of horsepower.  I doubt a jet chip or any other would give you more than 1or 2 hp.<BR>If you want a chip dont buy it for the horsepower, buy it to remove the rev limiter, the injector cut off bump at 1600rpm, and to elimante EGR operation.  I know i'm going to catch hell for the last statement, but i just dont believe in it, and i've been running fine without egr for quite sometime.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>       Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ Nitrous<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/hypsig.gif"> ||||reg||1
